PROJECT: Loyalty Management System
Author: Vamsi Mohan
Architecture: Cloud-Native Java Microservices

Technology Stack:
- Java 17+
- Spring Boot
- Spring Security (JWT)
- Spring Cloud Gateway
- Kafka (Event-Driven Architecture)
- Redis (Caching Layer)
- PostgreSQL (Database-per-Service)
- Docker & Docker Compose
- Feign Client + Resilience4j
- RESTful APIs (OpenAPI compliant)

---------------------------------------------------------------------

This project demonstrates a production-grade airline loyalty
management system including:

- API Gateway
- Authentication Service
- Customer Service
- Member Service (Single Source of Truth for Points)
- Partner Service
- Accrual Service
- Redemption Service
- Notification Service

The system follows:

- Database-per-service architecture
- Event-driven consistency using Kafka
- Immutable ledger design
- Derived balance model
- Tier computation model
- Strict service ownership boundaries

